  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 47562331eb8e4ae9b8602bb2935370c5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Introduction
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Exorcising Ghosts for Dummies
  subtitle: So something in your house is dead and angry. Don't panic. Read this
    page first.
  leftText: '<b>Before you begin</b>

    1. Name your ghost. Gather evidence and
    check your journal.

    2. Find its page in this book. The wrong verses will
    not work.

    3. Bring every offering the page asks for.


    <b>To begin</b>

    With
    this book in hand, touch the object the ghost has claimed.'
  rightText: '<b>During the rite</b>

    Speak each verse aloud, clearly, in Latin.
    The current verse glows red.

    Offerings go into the bowl: <i>first</i> before
    the words, <i>while</i> as you speak, <i>then</i> after.


    <b>Mistakes</b>

    Every
    mistake makes the ghost lash out. Too many and the circle shatters, and the ghost
    wakes furious.


    Do not wander off. It is listening.'
